{"id":2346,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>2026年4月16日，中北大学“聚才争流“促就业五学院联合招聘会在东区训练中心圆满落幕。本次招聘会由机械工程学院、机电工程学院、信息与通信工程学院、电气与控制工程学院、航空宇航学院联合主办。以\"用力搭建平台、用情精准对接、用心服务学子\"为理念，为用人单位与毕业生打造了高效务实的双向选择通道。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Ynzl44MNn2MlCaM84NZMzCiMNrfLRTifoR9DM4-bUmCZL7-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yaU1hknSyDnmrRLl-PLmUsozVVL4TVolC4nRCZUmCaMRnFnm-boll4LzfFU4nfL1b/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8MzNsgtA8pUDcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34597&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F0BBE6F5C1B124791E39E9F3D68B6044/F299E310/C4A2\" vheight=\"202.07000732421875\" vwidth=\"269.5299987792969\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Ynzl44MNn2MlCaM84NZMzCiMNrfLRTifoR9DM4-bUmCZL7-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yaU1hknSyDnmrRLl-PLmUsozVVL4TVolC4nRCZUmCaMRnFnm-boll4LzfFU4nfL1b/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8MzNsgtA8pUDcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34597&e=.jpeg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YMR-4PnmGZU4Uin8NMRn7WVL8-bMlliDoRNsLm7bLzN8LzC0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhRU1y8nkyZnzUYL47Yo7-sU8V7U4LDoRVkU49bnzvDMRnFLRNiUzVfLRnFnRlPokb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8MzNsgtA8pUDcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34597&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DCB4D8E423128B7CADC3681BC89E7644/095A1A04/D518\" vheight=\"201.60000610351562\" vwidth=\"268.8699951171875\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YMR-4PnmGZU4Uin8NMRn7WVL8-bMlliDoRNsLm7bLzN8LzC0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhRU1y8nkyZnzUYL47Yo7-sU8V7U4LDoRVkU49bnzvDMRnFLRNiUzVfLRnFnRlPokb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8MzNsgtA8pUDcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34597&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>本次联合招聘会聚焦中北大学优势工科专业集群，五所学院共汇集2026届本科毕业生2773人、硕士毕业生615人，覆盖机械设计制造、通信工程、电气工程、航空宇航科学与技术等多个国家战略新兴产业相关领域。经过前期精心筹备，招聘会吸引了来自兵器工业、航空航天、电子信息、智能制造等行业的50余家优质企业参与，提供就业岗位1800余个，其中研发类岗位占比达45%，与五学院学科特色高度契合。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YUNn4Vn7U4U8UbL84viUNrVo7CPMmQikU4TfnRlanl-bozU0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyiU1hknky8LlL8MRN8LmWRL77DM4VkUzfRMmCDL7VfMmTFoRrRnlVRo7VFUmNiUYb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8MzNsgtA8pUDcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34597&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/75BBD41C449422C0A671BA0C6660AA69/85CEAC8A/B95C\" vheight=\"201.39999389648438\" vwidth=\"269.4700012207031\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YUNn4Vn7U4U8UbL84viUNrVo7CPMmQikU4TfnRlanl-bozU0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyiU1hknky8LlL8MRN8LmWRL77DM4VkUzfRMmCDL7VfMmTFoRrRnlVRo7VFUmNiUYb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8MzNsgtA8pUDcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34597&e=.jpeg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YozG48L7LZMm7DL8lrRozUZU4fkMmUiPoRQfLNUZM4C8Ml-0gihFp2hmCIa0MYh7MYhkMkyYLRCsMNWfnRN4Um-ZozAkozW2L7LZM7Q7olVFnmC8ozvbU4MFUz7iMSb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8MzNsgtA8pUDcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34597&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7D7B420676BAD93B2898B92F0C84FD9A/F64979C3/A155\" vheight=\"201.60000610351562\" vwidth=\"268.8699951171875\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YozG48L7LZMm7DL8lrRozUZU4fkMmUiPoRQfLNUZM4C8Ml-0gihFp2hmCIa0MYh7MYhkMkyYLRCsMNWfnRN4Um-ZozAkozW2L7LZM7Q7olVFnmC8ozvbU4MFUz7iMSb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8MzNsgtA8pUDcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34597&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>招聘会现场，气氛热烈而有序。我院党委副书记李晓杰、就业负责人边国旗亲临现场，与企业代表深入交流行业发展趋势和人才需求方向，为校企合作搭建沟通桥梁。中国兵器工业集团、中国航天科技集团等知名企业设立专属展位，通过现场宣讲、互动问答等形式，向毕业生全面展示企业发展前景、薪酬福利体系和职业发展通道。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YL7U4ZL8CaM8-bM8zWVMzv8nlrfMRni2Lz7Doz-PUzl8nzC0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhRUSyiokyZM4VfoRVfUm9YnmLDMznRnzTkolr7MRUiLRTFUmTRnNLZMRTFolUbMSb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8MzNsgtA8pUDcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34597&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DCA58871A81AB82F3654CE9B9ED44509/B9CFC849/9D95\" vheight=\"202.1300048828125\" vwidth=\"269.3999938964844\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YL7U4ZL8CaM8-bM8zWVMzv8nlrfMRni2Lz7Doz-PUzl8nzC0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhRUSyiokyZM4VfoRVfUm9YnmLDMznRnzTkolr7MRUiLRTFUmTRnNLZMRTFolUbMSb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8MzNsgtA8pUDcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34597&e=.jpeg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YMR74YUzvaMNQ2n8znVMzCbL7nVLmCisMz-4MlCDU46fnRG0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyankh2U1yiLml8oz9bU8-DMl7aLRfkn7r2nmWfU8lsM7rFoRUanznkUzWFU8liMYb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8MzNsgtA8pUDcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34597&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/50DFB5254989CB65A000BDEFF2ACE74E/840E4BA2/CE57\" vheight=\"198.8000030517578\" vwidth=\"265.07000732421875\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YMR74YUzvaMNQ2n8znVMzCbL7nVLmCisMz-4MlCDU46fnRG0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyankh2U1yiLml8oz9bU8-DMl7aLRfkn7r2nmWfU8lsM7rFoRUanznkUzWFU8liMYb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8MzNsgtA8pUDcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34597&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>本次五学院联合招聘会是中北大学深化就业工作改革的一次有益尝试，有效提升了就业服务的针对性和实效性。下一步，学校将以此次活动为契机，进一步完善\"校院联动、校企协同、全员参与\"的就业工作机制，持续推进就业指导服务体系建设，为毕业生提供更加精准、高效、优质的就业服务，助力更多中北学子在新时代建功立业，为国家制造业高质量发展贡献青春力量。</p><p>中北大学研究生会</p><p>一审一校/王睿彬</p><p>二审二校/高申林</p><p>三审三校/边国旗</p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Ynzl44MNn2MlCaM84NZMzCiMNrfLRTifoR9DM4-bUmCZL7-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yaU1hknSyDnmrRLl-PLmUsozVVL4TVolC4nRCZUmCaMRnFnm-boll4LzfFU4nfL1b/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8MzNsgtA8pUDcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34597&e=.jpeg"}